      "get": {
        "description": "Get an account by id.\n\nClients observe HTTP 200 on success and 404 when the account does not\nexist.\n\nArgs:\n    account_id: Id of the account.\n    service: Account service.\n    actor: Caller context.\n\nReturns:\n    Stored account.",
